untless threats in multiple worlds... but it also brought all the heroes together, and they need your help! 😱\nCan you summon the strongest heroes and save these worlds together? 👊\n\n✨Collect powerful, unique characters to help you fight!\n⚔️Lead a team of anime units to defend against waves of enemies, tower defense style!\n💪Level up your units to unlock amazing abilities and build your own unique squad!\n\n❤️ Join our communications server to stay updated with exclusive codes, news, and sneak peeks. ❤️\n\n⭐ Join the group and like the game for an extra 500 starting GEMS + REROLLS!⭐\nDon't forget to leave a 👍 and ⭐.","path":"/game/107573139811370-anime-crusaders","slug":"107573139811370-anime-crusaders","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9a75bd64a682728a6394de89de395e4d885df26bc00fdaf50c1b98c4bdb28a02.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6250be94224f07e8eff5c449fa30d36f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":117559584,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-04T03:23:40.153Z","creator":{"name":"32x","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":5,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":106051943710043,"name":"[Mode Traits] Fistborn","desc":"\"A battle is won by him who is most resolved to win it.\"\n\nFistborn is a PvP-oriented game where players are capable of training to become stronger. Choose a style to master, or learn various skills to your liking and show off your fighting prowess.\n\nMake sure to like and favorite the game to show some support!\n\nThe controls and game information can be found in the Guide tab at the very start.\nKeybinds can be changed as you prefer in the settings menu under controls.\n\nPC Controls:\nE - Interact\nW + W - Run\nQ - Dash\nR - Combat/Fists\nM1 - Light Punch\nM2 - Heavy Punch\nF - Block & Dodge\nB - Carry \nV - Mount/Grip\nT - Mode\nP - Map Markers (Locations)\n\nController Controls:\nL1+R1 - Inventory\nR1+R2 - Mode\nL2 - Block\nL3 - Run\nR2 - M1\nY - M2\nB - Dash\nA - Jump\nX - Carry\nL1+X - 1\nL1+Y - 2\nL1+B - 3\nR1+X - 4\nR1+Y - 5\nR1+B - 6\nDPadUp - Mount/Grip\nDPadDown - Menu\nDPadLeft - Shift Lock\nDPadRight - Combat","path":"/game/106051943710043-fistborn","slug":"106051943710043-fistborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/84038fa06c8a3ef44cfac3831655dcadb43c9bac22aeb852b285109db511015d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3a09b799d9a0616dc0a2ef6507a1f978/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":15253062,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-16T12:43:00.574Z","creator":{"name":"Kengan","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":107397057618236,"name":"👵 Oldies","desc":"They’ve lived long enough to know all the tricks.\nEvery forgotten rule, every cane swing, every half-heard story—they’ve mastered them. These aren’t just elders; they’re legends of the past, ready to show you why they’re still standing.\n\nMade with 💙 by 1CoaI & alextubbaa","path":"/game/107397057618236-oldies","slug":"107397057618236-oldies","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e7790548f45ac0cb7560e8278bb7b5269fd0e1857a4c14db185c64f06e3a9a0a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-995da1138e6e8503032b3074aeb6bf34/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":4977343,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-25T19:10:47.435Z","creator":{"name":"0 CCU Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":108650546678909,"name":"[🎉NEW] Scary Hide &amp; Seek","desc":"Welcome to Scary Hide & Seek! 💀🔍\n\n🔦 HIDER: As a hider, your goal is to blend in with the environment by disguising yourself as everyday objects. Stay hidden, outsmart the seekers, and survive the hunt until the time runs out.\n🔪 SEEKER: As a seeker, your task is to hunt down players disguised as objects. Use your horrifying skills to track them down and reveal their hiding spots before they slip away.\n\n🔓 Collect coins to unlock powerful abilities, exclusive skins, and deadly weapons\n\n👍 D